  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "劇場版「機動戦士Z ガンダム 3-星の鼓動は愛-」でも活躍するエゥーゴの旗艦“アーガマ”EXモデルがリミテッドエディションとなって登場 。船体各部を設定色のつや消しメッキでコーティング 。主砲可動、メインブリッジはスライド可能、メガ粒子砲はパーツの差し替えにより展開を再現 。同スケールのMSミニフィギュア3体とアーガマ専用ディスプレイスタンドが付属",
      "en": "AEUGO's flagship \"Agama \" EX Model, which also plays an active role in the movie \" Mobile Suit Z Gundam 3 - The Heartbeat of the Stars is Love\", is now available as a limited edition. Each part of the hull is coated with matte plating in a set color. The main gun is movable, the main bridge is slidable, and the mega particle cannon can be recreated by replacing parts. Includes 3 MS minifigures of the same scale and a display stand for Argama."
    }
